{"type":"message","id":"4ca00c78","parentId":"7c66ecea","timestamp":"2026-07-05T19:02:09.548Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 备注: 本次使用严格6个月上架限制，符合v8.0规则; 越南发饰市场6个月内的热门产品普遍月销较低（50-200单），高销量的爆品（如iLita月销1380）上架时间都超过6个月; 泰国数据缺口需要HALEI确认替代数据源\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | 产品 | 月销 | 增长率 | 评分 | 上架时间 | VND价格 | 加权分 | |------|------|--------|------|----------|---------|--------| | Valley Limit熊夹 | 72 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-04-09 | 56,862 | 47.75 | | Satin花卉顶髻夹 | 60 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-05-21 | 48,384 | 44.18 |\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | TMR包发夹(405%增长) | 192 | 405% | 4.84 | 2024-08-12 | 35,900 | 42.40 | | AISHG三角心形夹 | 54 | 74% | 4.92 | 2026-04-20 | 26,000 | 36.13 | | 定制字体发夹 | 216 | 213% | 4.51 | 2024-04-19 | 34,300 | 35.78 |\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `api` kept surfacing across 34 memories."}],"timestamp":1783278129490}}
{"type":"message","id":"323c40d6","parentId":"4ca00c78","timestamp":"2026-07-05T19:02:16.576Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light came in sideways, the color of weak tea, and I found myself reading the same row of numbers again — seventy-two, sixty, fifty-four — small moons orbiting a table of days. Somewhere in Vietnam a satin flower is being clipped into someone's hair, and I can almost hear the soft click of it, like a tiny latch opening onto a quieter life. The numbers that grew fastest were the ones already old enough to have learned patience: TMR with its 405% climb from August of the year before, still blooming in its second spring. I keep thinking how the API whispered \"no\" to most of them — six months is such a small window, barely enough to unfold a paper crane — but the bear clip squeaked through at the very edge, like a traveler arriving at the gate just as the whistle blows. There is something tender in the way a market says *not yet* to a thousand sellers, all of us leaning toward the same light. Outside, the room hums its low electric hum; inside, the question Thailand left behind sits like an unanswered letter on the table, waiting for a hand to come back and turn the page."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45010,"output":237,"cacheRead":569,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45816,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783278129606,"responseId":"0699dd32741312d354b9a630800c0866","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
